4. Make sure generateDropdownOptions() is correct

Since your requirement is disable inactive Locations only and tooltip only for Locations, use:

private generateDropdownOptions(
  entities: ContextEntity[],
  type: AddPanelType
) {
  return entities.map((entity: any) => ({
    value: entity,

    viewValue:
      type === AddPanelType.BillingGroup
        ? `${entity.name} (${(entity as BillingGroup).billingGroupId})`
        : entity.name,

    disabled:
      type === AddPanelType.Location
        ? entity.active === false
        : false,

    tooltip:
      type === AddPanelType.Location
        ? entity.facilityId
        : undefined,
  }));
}

Now your demo data will test both requirements at the same time:

active: false → Location disabled

active: true → Location selectable

facilityId → tooltip

Customer → no tooltip/no active-based disabling

Billing Group → no tooltip/no active-based disabling



