One thing about id vs facilityId

Your Location model has both:

id: string;
facilityId: string;

You said you want the ID in the tooltip. If by ID you mean the actual id, change:

tooltip:
  type === AddPanelType.Location
    ? entity.facilityId
    : undefined,

to:

tooltip:
  type === AddPanelType.Location
    ? entity.id
    : undefined,

If the business requirement specifically says Facility ID, keep entity.facilityId.

For your current code, I'd use facilityId because your existing prefillLocationId() logic already treats facilityId as the Location identifier.